---
source: crates/view/tests/today.rs
expression: "portable(&r.html, empty.path())"
---
<div class="mv-screen">
<div class="mv-today" data-block="s" data-type="today">
<div class="mv-today-main">
<header class="mv-headline">
<p class="mv-composed bv-meta">Composed by Maestro · <span class="bv-code">the working tree</span> · read now</p>
<h1 class="mv-headline-text">What needs you could not be read. Running work could not be read. Whether a loop has gone silent is not known.</h1>
<div class="mv-pills">
<span class="mv-pill" data-tone="neutral" data-pill="needs you" data-partial="false">
<span class="mv-pill-value mv-unavailable">unavailable</span> needs you</span>
<span class="mv-pill" data-tone="neutral" data-pill="running" data-partial="false">
<span class="mv-pill-value mv-unavailable">unavailable</span> running</span>
<span class="mv-pill" data-tone="neutral" data-pill="open asks" data-partial="false">
<span class="mv-pill-value mv-unavailable">unavailable</span> open asks</span>
<span class="mv-pill" data-tone="neutral" data-pill="silent loops" data-partial="false">
<span class="mv-pill-value mv-unavailable">unavailable</span> silent loops</span>
<span class="mv-pill" data-tone="neutral" data-pill="landing" data-partial="false">
<span class="mv-pill-value mv-unavailable">unavailable</span> landing</span>
</div>
</header>
<section class="mv-card bv-card" data-block="today-decision" data-type="top-decision" data-state="unavailable">
<header class="mv-head">
<h2 class="mv-title">Top decision</h2>
<span class="mv-count mv-unavailable">unavailable</span>
</header>
<p class="mv-note" data-tone="danger">Could not be read. This is not the same as none.</p>
<details class="mv-errors">
<summary data-tone="warning">1 source could not be read</summary>
<ul>
<li>
<span class="bv-code">worktree:.broomva/asks</span>: No such file or directory (os error 2)</li>
</ul>
</details>
<p class="mv-source bv-meta">
<span class="bv-code">worktree:.broomva/asks</span>
</p>
</section>
<section class="mv-card bv-card" data-block="today-running" data-type="running" data-state="unavailable">
<header class="mv-head">
<h2 class="mv-title">Running now</h2>
<span class="mv-count mv-unavailable">unavailable</span>
</header>
<p class="mv-note" data-tone="danger">Could not be read. This is not the same as none.</p>
<details class="mv-errors">
<summary data-tone="warning">1 source could not be read</summary>
<ul>
<li>
<span class="bv-code">fs:<fixture>/work</span>: No such file or directory (os error 2)</li>
</ul>
</details>
<p class="mv-source bv-meta">
<span class="bv-code">fs:<fixture>/work</span>
</p>
</section>
<section class="mv-card bv-card" data-block="today-nodes" data-type="nodes" data-state="unavailable">
<header class="mv-head">
<h2 class="mv-title">Nodes</h2>
<span class="mv-count mv-unavailable">unavailable</span>
</header>
<p class="mv-note" data-tone="danger">Could not be read. This is not the same as none.</p>
<details class="mv-errors">
<summary data-tone="warning">1 source could not be read</summary>
<ul>
<li>
<span class="bv-code">nodes</span>: Maestro reads no node census yet; host adapters bring one (BRO-3276)</li>
</ul>
</details>
<p class="mv-source bv-meta">
<span class="bv-code">nodes</span>
</p>
</section>
</div>
